   "title": "HackNC 2026",
   "description": "<p>HackNC is a weekend for students of all skill levels to broaden their talents. Your challenge is to make an awesome project in just 24 hours. You will have access to hands-on tech workshops, sponsor networking, as well as exciting talks about the awesome things happening right now with computer science and technology &#8211; not to mention all of the free food, shirts, stickers, and swag! HackNC is the largest hackathon in the southeastern United States.</p>\n<p>Visit <a href=\"https://hacknc.com/\">hacknc.com</a>.</p>",
   "excerpt": "<p>HackNC is a weekend for students of all skill levels to broaden their talents. Your challenge is to make an awesome project in just 24 hours.</p>",
