   "title": "Mock Technical Interviewing Night with UNC CS Alumni",
   "description": "<p><i>This event is for UNC Computer Science and Data Science (BS) students only.</i></p>\n<p><strong>About this event:</strong> Alumni will work 1:1 with students to solve sample technical problems used during the recruiting process.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> All participating students are strongly encouraged to have completed COMP 210 (Data Structures) and be enrolled in or have completed COMP 550 (Algorithms &amp; Analysis).</p>\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg  oscitas-bootstrap-container\" target=\"_self\" href=\"https://unc.joinhandshake.com/edu/events/1975564/\">Register via Handshake</a>",
